/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Crime Analysis and Monitoring Portal, abbreviated as CAMP, is a robust application designed to enhance the efficiency of law enforcement agencies in managing, analyzing, and recording critical crime-related information. Developed in Python with PyQt5 for the graphical interface, CAMP integrates seamlessly with MySQL for secure and organized data storage.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
