197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our vision is to revolutionize the landscape of crime analysis and management by fostering a technologically advanced, user-friendly, and interconnected platform. We envision CAMP as a cornerstone in the digital transformation of law enforcement, equipping agencies with the tools they need to proactively address crime, protect citizens, and build trust within the communities they serve. Through continuous innovation, we aim to set new standards in the intersection of technology and public safety, making a lasting impact on the future of crime prevention and resolution.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
