/ActualText ("The backend of CAMP is responsible for managing the application's data, handling database interactions, and executing business logic. It is implemented using Python and utilizes the PyQt5 library for the graphical user interface \(GUI\) components. The primary functionalities of the backend include database connectivity, CRUD \(Create, Read, Update, Delete\) operations for police stations, criminals, and criminal cases, as well as additional features for case status updates and criminal deletion.")
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
